    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Little dumplings can do big things. And "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Bao"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " did! It took home an Oscar for Best Animated Short Film! Chinese-Canadian "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Domee Shi",
            "zh": "石之予"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " wrote and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "directed",
            "zh": "导演"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "short",
            "zh": "短片"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "There is a Chinese-Canadian mother in the short. Her son grows up and leaves home. The mother feels "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "lonely",
            "ref": "v-lonely"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". One day, a dumpling "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "comes to life",
            "ref": "v-come-to-life"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". She is happy to have Bao, the dumpling boy. She tries to protect Bao all the time."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "But Bao starts growing up fast. He is not that close to his mother. He becomes a young "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "adult",
            "ref": "v-adult"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". He brings his girlfriend home and wants to move out. Trying to stop Bao from leaving, the mother eats him! But she "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "regrets",
            "ref": "v-regret"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " it "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "right away",
            "ref": "v-right-away"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "It was all a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "dream",
            "ref": "v-dream"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". When the mother wakes up, she "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "notices",
            "ref": "v-notice"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " that her son has come to visit her. He and his girlfriend join the mother in making dumplings."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The story is about the parent-child "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "relationship",
            "zh": "关系"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". After watching "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Bao"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", a girl told Shi that she loved the short. And she said to her mother, “You’d better not eat me when I go off to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "college",
            "ref": "v-college"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ".”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
